invariant: INV-16
file: ct.h
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: ct.h takes CH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL beside CH_WIDEMUL_RUNTIME, so the files
  under their own names, which every answer but CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME
  runs, compile to the native multiply, and the answer picks between two
  copies of one multiply. test/widemul-builds.sh requires that build not
  to compile.

--- old
#if defined(CH_WIDEMUL_RUNTIME) && defined(CH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL)
#error "WIDEMUL=runtime takes the multiply's timing from each session: drop -DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL"
#endif
--- new
